#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement keepsElementsInAny unions returns the elements that occur in at least one of the given sets, equivalent to folding union over the list starting from empty.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement emptyListOfSetsYieldsEmptySet unions of an empty list of sets is the empty set.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
